{"id":86615,"slug":"rodinn-sraz-2019","title":"Rodinný sraz","title_en":"Family Reunion","year":2019,"rating":62,"votes_count":31,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"Když se McKellanovi přestěhují ze Seattlu do maloměsta v Georgii, je jejich životní styl konfrontován jižanským způsobem života a konzervativními prarodiči.(Netflix)","poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/165/259/165259434_380bd2.jpg","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Komedie"],"tags":["rodina","sitcom"],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Morenike Joela Evans","Jody Margolin Hahn","Kelly Park","Angela Barnes","Robbie Countryman","Juanesta Holmes","Eric Dean Seaton","Richard Lyons","Russell Griffin","Leonard R. Garner Jr.","Sheldon Epps","Michael A. Joseph","John Simmons"],"actors":["Anthony Alabi","Loretta Devine","Talia Jackson","Jordyn Raya James","Tia Mowry","Isaiah Russell-Bailey","Cameron J. Wright","Camaron Engels","Luke Eisner","Lexi Underwood","Noah Alexander Gerry","Jalyn Hall","Darren Barnet","Ebboney Wilson","Ron Pearson","Jaida-Iman Benjamin","Dominique Toney","Telma Hopkins","Jonathan Ohye","Anika Noni Rose","Richard Roundtree","Amir O'Neil","Kenya Moore","Candiace Dillard","Brandi Glanville","Skyler Elyse Philpot","Tanyell Waivers","Ariel Martin","Tahj Mowry","Timothy Stack","Eric Allard","Bella Podaras","Tasia Sherel","Austin Kane","Warren Burke","Mark Curry","Marc Oka","Bruce Bruce","Ashlee Brian","Kelly Perine","Naomi Grace","Jaidyn Triplett","Sean Samuels","Nicco Annan","Erica Ash","Monique Coleman","Jadah Marie","Tristan Cunningham","Rudy Martinez","Willie Gault","Daniele Lawson","Calah Lane","Lynette DuPree","Zuri Starks","Joachim Powell","Zachary S. Williams","Jahdai Pickett","Sloan Robinson","Staci Lynn Fletcher","Journey Carter"],"screenwriters":["Lia Prewitt-Martin","Howard Jordan Jr.","Charity L. Miller","Anthony C. Hill","Ralph Greene","Meg DeLoatch","Deja Harrell","Christopher B. Moore","Sa'Rah Jones","Arthur Harris","Bill Boulware","Henry 'Hank' Jones","Shawnte McCall"],"cinematographers":["John Simmons"],"composers":["Wendell Hanes"],"reviews":[{"author":"chrispe","text":"Přiznávám bez mučení, že jsem si po prvním dílu myslela, že skončím někde v polovině první řady. Působilo to na mě moc křečovitě a viděla jsem v tom takový ten (pro mě protivný) disney vibe. A taky narovinu - energie černé rodiny je úplně jiná, než když koukáte třeba na Krok za krokem. Ale já si ty lidi fakt oblíbila. Nejvíc rodiče Moze a Cocou. Ti dva mají mezi sebou krásnou chemii (a na oba se sakra dobře dívá). Svérázná babička a děda, pastor, který ne vždy miluje bližního svého na první dobrou a čtyři celkem rozmazlené děti, si už tu oblíbenost museli sakra vydřít. :D Je to rodinný seriál, moralizuje a všechno v něm dobře dopadne. Ale nebojí se zároveň ukázat na věci, které lidem s tmavou barvou pleti nikdo rozhodně nezávidí.(03.08.2022)","stars":3}],"vods":[{"platform":"Netflix","url":"https://www.netflix.com/title/80234451"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/742864-rodinny-sraz/prehled/","root_id":742864,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":5,"episode_count":44,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":"2026-01-04","last_vod_date":"2026-01-04","episodes":[{"season_no":2,"episode_no":8,"vod_date":"2026-01-04","title":"Pamatujete na patnáct minut M'dear? (S02E08)","platforms":["Netflix"]}]}